{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "no-longer-human",
  "chunk_id": "no-longer-human-chunk-0239",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "啊，我的周圍總是籠罩著一股渾濁、灰暗、形跡可疑的氣息。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ah, my surroundings were always shrouded in a murky, gloomy, suspicious sort of atmosphere.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "「你儘量想法幫我應付一下，拜託了，老闆娘。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Please, do whatever you can to help me manage this, madam.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我親你一下吧。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I will give you a kiss for it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "老闆娘的臉一下子羞得通紅。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The proprietress's face instantly flushed bright red with embarrassment.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "我又趁機說道：「沒有藥，工作根本無法進行。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I seized the chance and went on, Without the medicine, I cannot get any work done at all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "對我來說，它就像壯陽藥。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "For me, it is like a tonic for virility.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "「那你還不如注射荷爾蒙呢。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then you might as well get hormone injections.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "「你可別開玩笑了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Do not joke about it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "要麼靠酒，要麼靠藥，二者缺一，我都無法正常工作。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It has to be either alcohol or that medicine; without one or the other, I cannot work properly.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "「酒可真的不行。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Alcohol is really out of the question.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "「是吧？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Right?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "自從用了這種藥後，我可是滴酒未沾呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Since I started using this medicine, I have not touched a single drop of alcohol.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00239",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "多虧了它，身體狀態非常好。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Thanks to it, my physical condition is very good.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
